{{!
  Template: identity-added
  Data keys:
    - name           {string}  Recipient's first name
    - identityType   {string}  Type of identity added (e.g. Phone, Email, Instagram)
    - maskedValue    {string}  Masked representation of the identity value
    - addedAt        {string}  Timestamp when added
    - isVerified     {boolean} True if identity is verified
    - appUrl         {string}  Base URL of the app
    - unsubscribeToken {string}
    - currentYear    {number}
}}
<p class='email-greeting'>Security Alert: New {{identityType}} Added 🔒</p>

<p>
  Hello{{#if name}} {{name}}{{/if}},
</p>

<p>
  A new <strong>{{identityType}}</strong> was recently linked to your BreathAway account:
</p>

<div style='background-color: #F9FAFB; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px; margin: 24px 0;'>
  <table style='width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;'>
    <tr>
      <td style='padding: 6px 0; color: #6B7280; font-size: 14px;'>Type:</td>
      <td style='padding: 6px 0; text-align: right; font-weight: 600; color: #1A1A2E; font-size: 14px;'>{{identityType}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style='padding: 6px 0; color: #6B7280; font-size: 14px;'>Identifier:</td>
      <td style='padding: 6px 0; text-align: right; font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; color: #1A1A2E;'>{{maskedValue}}</td>
    </tr>
    {{#if addedAt}}
    <tr>
      <td style='padding: 6px 0; color: #6B7280; font-size: 14px;'>Date &amp; Time:</td>
      <td style='padding: 6px 0; text-align: right; color: #6B7280; font-size: 13px;'>{{addedAt}}</td>
    </tr>
    {{/if}}
  </table>
</div>

<p>
  <strong>Did you make this change?</strong><br />
  If yes, you can safely ignore this message. Your new contact method is now active.
</p>

<div class='email-alert email-alert--danger'>
  <strong>Don't recognize this activity?</strong><br />
  If you did not link this {{identityType}}, someone may have gained unauthorized access to your account.
  Please secure your account immediately.
</div>

<div style='text-align: center; margin: 32px 0;'>
  <a href='{{appUrl}}/settings/security' class='email-btn'>Review Security Settings →</a>
</div>

<hr class='email-divider' />

<p style='font-size: 13px; color: #9CA3AF; text-align: center;'>
  BreathAway Security Team
</p>
